# Shared base: what the librarian agent itself needs at run time.
#
# Every bench runs the agent in-process, so every bench's lock includes this.
# It mirrors `[project].dependencies` in the root pyproject.toml, minus fastapi
# and uvicorn: a --via-api run talks to an orchestrator in the repository's own
# .venv, not in the bench environment.
#
# Only dependencies are listed; the repository's own code arrives on PYTHONPATH.
# Keep this in step with pyproject.toml by hand — nothing checks it.
